  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Không gian mẫu là tập hợp gồm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn></mrow></semantics></math> người điều trị bệnh nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tGọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> là biến cố: ““ Người đó khỏi bệnh””&thinsp; và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> là biến cố: ““ Người đó uống thuốc <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>X</mi></semantics></math>””.<br>\n\t\t\tKhi đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là biến cố: ““ Người đó khỏi bệnh và uống thuốc <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>X</mi></semantics></math>””.<br>\n\t\t\tTa có số người uống thuốc <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>X</mi></semantics></math> là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>600</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>800</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>400</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>400</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>400</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tTrong những người khỏi bệnh và uống thuốc <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>X</mi></semantics></math> có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>600</mn></mrow></semantics></math> người nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>600</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>600</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>:</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tVậy xác suất để người đó khỏi bệnh nếu biết người đó uống thuốc <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>X</mi></semantics></math> là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></semantics></math>.</li><li>Gọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> là biến cố: ““ Người đó uống thuốc <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>Y</mi></semantics></math>””&thinsp; và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>D</mi></semantics></math> là biến cố: ““ Người đó khỏi bệnh””.<br>\n\t\t\tKhi đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là biến cố: ““ Người đó uống thuốc <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>Y</mi></semantics></math> và khỏi bệnh””.<br>\n\t\t\tTa có số người khỏi bệnh là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>600</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>200</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>800</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>800</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>800</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>7</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div><br>\n\t\t\tCó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>200</mn></mrow></semantics></math> người uống thuốc <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>Y</mi></semantics></math> và khỏi bệnh nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>200</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>200</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>000</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>:</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>7</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tVậy xác suất để người bệnh đó uống thuốc <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>Y</mi></semantics></math>, biết rằng người đó khỏi bệnh là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
